+# Password Hashing
+
+No decision on the password hashing algorithm is currently recorded for this project. The project's recorded decisions cover other topics (caching, encoding format, async runtime, versioning, licensing, and transport security) but none selects a password hashing algorithm, so no algorithm or parameters are specified here. This policy should be updated once a decision is made and recorded.
